# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rotate bosonic modes {#rotate-bosonic-modes}"
msgstr "Merotasi mode bosonik {#rotate-bosonic-modes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") mixes bosonic modes with a unitary matrix $U$, as a network of beamsplitters and phase shifters does. It is called **passive** because it conserves the total boson number: it moves bosons between modes and never creates or destroys one. (Squeezing and displacement are the *active* operations, and a mode rotation cannot express them.) It maps the creation operators as\n"
msgstr "Sebuah [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") mencampur mode bosonik dengan matriks uniter $U$, seperti jaringan beamsplitter dan phase shifter. Disebut **pasif** karena ia mempertahankan jumlah total boson: ia memindahkan boson antar mode dan tidak pernah menciptakan atau menghancurkannya. (Squeezing dan displacement adalah operasi *aktif*, dan rotasi mode tidak bisa mengungkapkannya.) Ia memetakan operator creation sebagai\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"b^\\dagger_i \\mapsto \\sum_j U_{ji} \\, b^\\dagger_j \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"b^\\dagger_i \\mapsto \\sum_j U_{ji} \\, b^\\dagger_j \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "which on the full Fock space is the many-body unitary\n"
msgstr "yang pada seluruh ruang Fock adalah uniter many-body\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\exp\\left(\\sum_{ij} \\log(U)_{ij} \\, b^\\dagger_i b_j\\right) \\, .\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\exp\\left(\\sum_{ij} \\log(U)_{ij} \\, b^\\dagger_i b_j\\right) \\, .\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is the gate behind a linear-optical interferometer: send Fock states in, rotate the modes, and read out how the bosons redistribute. Like every gate of a [`BosonicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-bosonic-circuit#qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit\") (see [Work with bosonic circuits](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation)), it carries no truncation and no encoding. Both enter at transpile time, and this guide shows why the truncation needs particular care for a rotation.\n"
msgstr "Ini adalah gate di balik interferometer optik linear: kirim state Fock masuk, rotasikan mode-modenya, lalu baca bagaimana boson terdistribusi ulang. Seperti setiap gate dari [`BosonicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-bosonic-circuit#qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.BosonicCircuit\") (lihat [Bekerja dengan Circuit bosonik](circuit#bosonic-circuit-explanation)), ia tidak membawa pemotongan maupun encoding. Keduanya masuk saat waktu transpile, dan panduan ini menunjukkan kenapa pemotongan butuh perhatian khusus untuk sebuah rotasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a rotation {#build-a-rotation}"
msgstr "Bangun sebuah rotasi {#build-a-rotation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The constructor takes the $M \\times M$ unitary matrix. The gate acts on $M$ modes. The class does not check that the matrix is unitary, so that is your responsibility.\n"
msgstr "Konstruktor menerima matriks uniter $M \\times M$. Gate bekerja pada $M$ mode. Kelas ini tidak mengecek apakah matriksnya uniter, jadi itu tanggung jawabmu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Common rotations have dedicated constructors. [`ModeRotation.beamsplitter()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.beamsplitter \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.beamsplitter\") takes a mixing angle $\\theta$ and an optional phase $\\phi$, and $\\theta = \\pi/4$ gives the balanced 50:50 beamsplitter. [`ModeRotation.phase_shift()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.phase_shift \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.phase_shift\") takes one phase per mode.\n"
msgstr "Rotasi umum punya konstruktor khusus. [`ModeRotation.beamsplitter()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.beamsplitter \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.beamsplitter\") menerima sudut pencampuran $\\theta$ dan fase opsional $\\phi$, dan $\\theta = \\pi/4$ memberi beamsplitter 50:50 yang seimbang. [`ModeRotation.phase_shift()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.phase_shift \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.phase_shift\") menerima satu fase per mode.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also start from the anti-Hermitian generator $K$ and let the gate exponentiate it, which gives the rotation $\\exp(K)$. The generator is recovered with [`generator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.generator \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.generator\").\n"
msgstr "Kamu juga bisa mulai dari generator anti-Hermitian $K$ dan membiarkan gate meng-eksponensialkannya, yang memberi rotasi $\\exp(K)$. Generatornya didapat kembali dengan [`generator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.generator \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.generator\").\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The bridge to the operator algebra is [`to_operator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator\"), which returns the Hermitian generator $H = \\sum_{ij} \\mathrm{i} \\log(U)_{ij} \\, b^\\dagger_i b_j$ as a [`BosonOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/operators-boson-operator#qiskit_bosons.operators.BosonOperator \"qiskit_bosons.operators.BosonOperator\"), so that the gate is $e^{-\\mathrm{i} H}$. For the 50:50 beamsplitter, that is a pair of hopping terms with opposite imaginary coefficients. The operator is Hermitian, which is what an [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate needs, and it conserves the particle number.\n"
msgstr "Jembatan ke aljabar operator adalah [`to_operator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator\"), yang mengembalikan generator Hermitian $H = \\sum_{ij} \\mathrm{i} \\log(U)_{ij} \\, b^\\dagger_i b_j$ sebagai [`BosonOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/operators-boson-operator#qiskit_bosons.operators.BosonOperator \"qiskit_bosons.operators.BosonOperator\"), sehingga gate-nya adalah $e^{-\\mathrm{i} H}$. Untuk beamsplitter 50:50, itu berupa sepasang suku hopping dengan koefisien imajiner berlawanan. Operatornya Hermitian, yang memang dibutuhkan gate [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\"), dan ia mempertahankan jumlah partikel.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each term reads `(is_creation, mode)` from left to right, so the second one is $\\mathrm{i} \\tfrac{\\pi}{4} \\, b^\\dagger_1 b_0$.\n"
msgstr "Setiap suku dibaca sebagai `(is_creation, mode)` dari kiri ke kanan, jadi yang kedua adalah $\\mathrm{i} \\tfrac{\\pi}{4} \\, b^\\dagger_1 b_0$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Act on Fock states {#act-on-fock-states}"
msgstr "Bekerja pada state Fock {#act-on-fock-states}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A rotation moves bosons between modes, so its effect is easiest to see on Fock states. The Hong-Ou-Mandel effect is the standard example. Send one boson into each input mode of a balanced beamsplitter. The two paths that leave the bosons in different output modes interfere destructively, so the state $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$ disappears and the bosons always leave together, in $\\lvert 2, 0 \\rangle$ or $\\lvert 0, 2 \\rangle$, each with probability one half.\n"
msgstr "Sebuah rotasi memindahkan boson antar mode, jadi efeknya paling mudah dilihat pada state Fock. Efek Hong-Ou-Mandel adalah contoh standarnya. Kirim satu boson ke tiap mode input dari beamsplitter seimbang. Dua jalur yang meninggalkan boson di mode output berbeda berinterferensi destruktif, sehingga state $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$ lenyap dan boson selalu keluar bersama, di $\\lvert 2, 0 \\rangle$ atau $\\lvert 0, 2 \\rangle$, masing-masing dengan probabilitas setengah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build the circuit on bosonic modes and lower it with the preset pass manager. The [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") fixes the truncation and the encoding at this point. A cutoff of `max_occupation=2` keeps the levels 0, 1, and 2 of every mode.\n"
msgstr "Bangun Circuit pada mode bosonik dan turunkan dengan preset pass manager. [`LevelSpec`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec\") menetapkan pemotongan dan encoding pada titik ini. Cutoff `max_occupation=2` mempertahankan level 0, 1, dan 2 dari setiap mode.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The pipeline returns an ordinary qubit circuit. Read the outcome probabilities from the final state, here with Qiskit’s [`Statevector`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector), which is exact at this size. Any simulator that returns amplitudes or counts works. A Fock state $\\lvert n_0, n_1 \\rangle$ is a single computational basis state, whose index is given by the bit patterns of [`LevelEncoding.level_to_bits()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelEncoding.level_to_bits \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelEncoding.level_to_bits\"); the second mode’s qubits follow the first mode’s.\n"
msgstr "Pipeline mengembalikan Circuit qubit biasa. Baca probabilitas hasil dari state akhir, di sini dengan [`Statevector`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector) milik Qiskit, yang eksak pada ukuran ini. Simulator apa pun yang mengembalikan amplitudo atau counts bisa dipakai. State Fock $\\lvert n_0, n_1 \\rangle$ adalah satu computational basis state, yang indeksnya diberikan oleh pola bit dari [`LevelEncoding.level_to_bits()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelEncoding.level_to_bits \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelEncoding.level_to_bits\"); qubit mode kedua mengikuti qubit mode pertama.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$ outcome has probability zero, and the two bunched outcomes share the probability equally.\n"
msgstr "Hasil $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$ punya probabilitas nol, dan dua hasil bunched berbagi probabilitas secara merata.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the cutoff {#choose-the-cutoff}"
msgstr "Pilih cutoff {#choose-the-cutoff}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The previous result needs `max_occupation=2`. Run the same circuit with a cutoff of 1. That is enough to hold the input state $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$, but not the state that the rotation produces from it, which has weight on $\\lvert 2, 0 \\rangle$ and $\\lvert 0, 2 \\rangle$:\n"
msgstr "Hasil sebelumnya membutuhkan `max_occupation=2`. Jalankan Circuit yang sama dengan cutoff 1. Itu cukup untuk menampung state input $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$, tapi tidak untuk state yang dihasilkan rotasi darinya, yang punya bobot pada $\\lvert 2, 0 \\rangle$ dan $\\lvert 0, 2 \\rangle$:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The circuit runs without any error, and the answer is wrong: the state stays at $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$ with probability one. A rotation mixes occupation sectors *within* a mode. Two bosons can end up in the same output mode, so the exact state has weight on occupation 2 in a mode that started with one boson. With a cutoff of 1 that level does not exist, and the truncated generator cannot move the state there.\n"
msgstr "Circuit berjalan tanpa error apa pun, dan jawabannya salah: state tetap di $\\lvert 1, 1 \\rangle$ dengan probabilitas satu. Rotasi mencampur sektor okupansi *di dalam* satu mode. Dua boson bisa berakhir di mode output yang sama, jadi state eksak punya bobot pada okupansi 2 di mode yang awalnya berisi satu boson. Dengan cutoff 1 level itu tidak ada, dan generator terpotong tidak bisa memindahkan state ke sana.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A bound on the occupation of the initial state is therefore not enough. The cutoff must cover the total boson number that can reach **any single mode** of the rotation. For $N$ bosons in total, the safe choice is a cutoff of $N$.\n"
msgstr "Batas pada okupansi state awal karena itu tidak cukup. Cutoff harus mencakup jumlah total boson yang bisa sampai ke **satu mode mana pun** dari rotasi. Untuk total $N$ boson, pilihan aman adalah cutoff $N$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The same reasoning applies to every mode separately, so a mix of different cutoffs per mode (see [Describe the truncation with a LevelSpec](mappers#level-spec-explanation)) makes a rotation easy to map incorrectly. A mode that can receive bosons needs a cutoff that covers what it can receive, not only what it holds initially. The check [`LevelSpec.truncation()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec.truncation \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec.truncation\") compares a spec with the occupation lower bound of an operator. It cannot flag the case above. Each term of the beamsplitter generator holds a single creation operator, so the bound is one and the check reports no shortfall at a cutoff of 1, although the result there is wrong:\n"
msgstr "Penalaran yang sama berlaku untuk tiap mode secara terpisah, jadi campuran cutoff berbeda per mode (lihat [Deskripsikan pemotongan dengan LevelSpec](mappers#level-spec-explanation)) membuat rotasi mudah dipetakan secara keliru. Mode yang bisa menerima boson butuh cutoff yang mencakup apa yang bisa diterimanya, bukan hanya apa yang dipegangnya di awal. Pengecekan [`LevelSpec.truncation()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-level-spec#qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec.truncation \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.LevelSpec.truncation\") membandingkan sebuah spec dengan batas bawah okupansi dari sebuah operator. Ia tidak bisa menandai kasus di atas. Setiap suku generator beamsplitter memegang satu operator creation, jadi batasnya satu dan pengecekan tidak melaporkan kekurangan pada cutoff 1, padahal hasilnya di sana salah:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A further caution follows from the way the transpiler builds a rotation (next section). It applies the rotation as a sequence of two-mode factors, and the plugin documentation warns that a single factor can populate a level that the complete rotation never reaches. The truncated sequence and the truncated single evolution are then different approximations of the same unitary. A search over 1,080 random three-mode rotations, with one boson in each of two input modes and no double occupation in the output, did not turn up such a case, so treat this as a precaution and not as a common failure. Converge the cutoff as you would for any other circuit, by increasing it until the result stops changing.\n"
msgstr "Peringatan lebih lanjut muncul dari cara Transpiler membangun rotasi (bagian berikutnya). Ia menerapkan rotasi sebagai urutan faktor dua-mode, dan dokumentasi plugin memperingatkan bahwa satu faktor bisa mengisi level yang tidak pernah dicapai rotasi lengkapnya. Urutan terpotong dan evolusi tunggal terpotong itu kemudian menjadi aproksimasi berbeda dari uniter yang sama. Pencarian atas 1.080 rotasi tiga-mode acak, dengan satu boson di masing-masing dari dua mode input dan tanpa okupansi ganda di output, tidak menemukan kasus seperti itu, jadi anggap ini sebagai tindakan pencegahan, bukan kegagalan yang umum. Konvergenkan cutoff seperti untuk Circuit lain, dengan menaikkannya sampai hasilnya berhenti berubah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "How the transpiler synthesizes a rotation {#how-the-transpiler-synthesizes-a-rotation}"
msgstr "Cara Transpiler mensintesis sebuah rotasi {#how-the-transpiler-synthesizes-a-rotation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `optimization` stage of the preset pipeline breaks a [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") down in bosonic space first, with the [`B2BSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-b-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis\") pass and the [`BosonicClementsDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-synthesis-bosonic-clements-decomposition#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.synthesis.BosonicClementsDecomposition \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.synthesis.BosonicClementsDecomposition\") method (registered as `ModeRotation.Clements`). That is a choice of the preset and not a requirement of the framework: a later section lowers the same gate without any decomposition. The decomposition does not exponentiate the full generator in one step. It first factorizes the unitary into at most $M(M-1)/2$ rotations between *adjacent* modes plus $M$ single-mode phases, following the rectangular mesh of Clements et al. <span id=\"id1\" />[\\[1\\]](#id2). Each factor becomes an atomic [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate, which the boson-to-qubit stage maps like any other.\n"
msgstr "Tahap `optimization` dari preset pipeline menguraikan [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") di ruang bosonik terlebih dahulu, dengan pass [`B2BSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-b-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2BSynthesis\") dan metode [`BosonicClementsDecomposition`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-synthesis-bosonic-clements-decomposition#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.synthesis.BosonicClementsDecomposition \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.synthesis.BosonicClementsDecomposition\") (terdaftar sebagai `ModeRotation.Clements`). Itu adalah pilihan preset, bukan persyaratan framework: bagian berikutnya menurunkan gate yang sama tanpa dekomposisi apa pun. Dekomposisi ini tidak meng-eksponensialkan generator penuh dalam satu langkah. Ia pertama memfaktorkan uniter menjadi paling banyak $M(M-1)/2$ rotasi antara mode yang *bersebelahan* ditambah $M$ fase single-mode, mengikuti mesh persegi panjang dari Clements dkk. <span id=\"id1\" />[\\[1\\]](#id2). Setiap faktor menjadi gate [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") atomik, yang dipetakan tahap boson-ke-qubit seperti yang lain.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The factorization itself is [`givens_decomposition()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/linalg-givens-decomposition#qiskit_bosons.linalg.givens_decomposition \"qiskit_bosons.linalg.givens_decomposition\"), which the decomposition calls. The map from a unitary to the many-body rotation is a group homomorphism, so the product of the factor rotations exactly equals the full rotation on the untruncated space. The mesh therefore adds no error of its own. Its benefit is locality. Each emitted evolution involves only the Pauli terms of the two modes it mixes (or of one mode for a phase), instead of terms across all modes.\n"
msgstr "Faktorisasi itu sendiri adalah [`givens_decomposition()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/linalg-givens-decomposition#qiskit_bosons.linalg.givens_decomposition \"qiskit_bosons.linalg.givens_decomposition\"), yang dipanggil oleh dekomposisi tersebut. Pemetaan dari sebuah unitary ke rotasi many-body adalah homomorfisme grup, jadi hasil kali rotasi-rotasi faktor persis sama dengan rotasi penuh pada ruang yang tidak dipotong. Dengan begitu, mesh ini tidak menambah galat apa pun. Keuntungannya ada pada lokalitas. Setiap evolusi yang dihasilkan hanya melibatkan suku Pauli dari dua mode yang dicampurnya (atau dari satu mode untuk sebuah fase), bukan suku-suku dari semua mode.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile a random three-mode rotation and inspect what the pipeline emitted. A generic $3 \\times 3$ unitary needs the maximum of three rotations, plus three phases, and every factor is its own [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate). All of them are declared on the whole register, but the operators inside act on a few qubits only:\n"
msgstr "Transpile rotasi acak tiga mode lalu periksa apa yang dihasilkan pipeline. Unitary $3 \\times 3$ yang generik membutuhkan tiga rotasi maksimum, ditambah tiga fase, dan setiap faktor adalah [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate) tersendiri. Semuanya dideklarasikan pada seluruh register, tetapi operator di dalamnya hanya bekerja pada beberapa qubit saja:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With three levels per mode, every mode occupies three qubits. A beamsplitter between two modes touches the six qubits of those modes, and a phase touches the qubits of one mode.\n"
msgstr "Dengan tiga level per mode, setiap mode menempati tiga qubit. Sebuah beamsplitter di antara dua mode menyentuh enam qubit dari kedua mode itu, dan sebuah fase menyentuh qubit dari satu mode.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The factors are exact only once each evolution is synthesized well. The terms of a beamsplitter generator do not commute, so the default single-step product formula leaves an error in every factor. Pass a product formula with more repetitions to the [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") plugin that maps the factors to reduce it:\n"
msgstr "Faktor-faktor ini baru eksak kalau setiap evolusi disintesis dengan baik. Suku-suku dari generator beamsplitter tidak saling komut, jadi product formula satu langkah bawaan menyisakan galat di setiap faktor. Berikan product formula dengan repetisi lebih banyak ke plugin [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.Evolution\") yang memetakan faktor-faktor tersebut untuk mengurangi galat itu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A single boson entering mode 0 leaves in mode $j$ with probability $|U_{j0}|^2$. Compare the synthesized circuit with that exact result for increasing repetition counts. Decompose the circuit first so that the product formula is applied; without it, an exact simulator such as [`Statevector`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector) applies the gate as its full exponential and hides the error.\n"
msgstr "Satu boson yang masuk ke mode 0 keluar di mode $j$ dengan probabilitas $|U_{j0}|^2$. Bandingkan circuit hasil sintesis dengan hasil eksak itu untuk jumlah repetisi yang meningkat. Dekomposisi circuit-nya dulu supaya product formula diterapkan; tanpa itu, simulator eksak seperti [`Statevector`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector) menerapkan gate sebagai eksponensial penuhnya dan menyembunyikan galatnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The error falls by a factor of about four for every fourfold increase in repetitions, as expected for a first-order formula. The cost grows in proportion, because every factor is repeated.\n"
msgstr "Galat turun sekitar empat kali lipat setiap kali repetisi naik empat kali lipat, sesuai harapan untuk formula orde pertama. Biayanya naik secara proporsional, karena setiap faktor diulang.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"mode-rotation-direct-explanation\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lower a rotation without decomposing it {#lower-a-rotation-without-decomposing-it}"
msgstr "Menurunkan rotasi tanpa mendekomposisinya {#lower-a-rotation-without-decomposing-it}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A decomposition in bosonic space is one way to lower a rotation. (The library does not include another way, but the boson-to-qubit stage does not depend on it.) [`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\") looks a plugin up by the name of the gate, and a [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") that was left whole reaches it like any other gate. A plugin for it maps the generator of [`ModeRotation.to_operator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator\") in one go and emits a single [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate) at unit time. That is all of it:\n"
msgstr "Dekomposisi di ruang bosonik adalah salah satu cara untuk menurunkan rotasi. (Library ini tidak menyertakan cara lain, tetapi tahap boson-ke-qubit tidak bergantung padanya.) [`B2QSynthesis`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes-b-2-q-synthesis#qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes.B2QSynthesis\") mencari plugin berdasarkan nama gate, dan [`ModeRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation\") yang dibiarkan utuh sampai ke sana seperti gate lainnya. Plugin untuknya memetakan generator dari [`ModeRotation.to_operator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library-mode-rotation#qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library.ModeRotation.to_operator\") sekaligus dan menghasilkan satu [`PauliEvolutionGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.PauliEvolutionGate) pada waktu satuan. Hanya itu saja:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Register it for the name of the gate in a pass manager that does not decompose it:\n"
msgstr "Daftarkan plugin itu untuk nama gate di pass manager yang tidak mendekomposisinya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The rotation is now one evolution over all nine qubits, where the mesh has six, of which none spans more than six. The two are not the same approximation. The truncation is applied once to the generator of the whole rotation here, and to every factor separately in the mesh (hence the warning on the cutoff above). The direct path equals [`occupation_encoding()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-library-occupation-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding\") of the operator at any cutoff, so it is the reference to compare a mesh against. What it costs is locality: its terms span all modes, and a product formula has more of them to subdivide.\n"
msgstr "Sekarang rotasinya adalah satu evolusi atas kesembilan qubit, sedangkan mesh punya enam, yang tidak satu pun mencakup lebih dari enam. Keduanya bukan pendekatan yang sama. Pemotongan di sini diterapkan sekali pada generator seluruh rotasi, dan pada setiap faktor secara terpisah di mesh (karena itu ada peringatan tentang cutoff di atas). Jalur langsung sama dengan [`occupation_encoding()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/mappers-library-occupation-encoding#qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding \"qiskit_bosons.mappers.library.occupation_encoding\") dari operator pada cutoff berapa pun, jadi ini adalah acuan untuk membandingkan sebuah mesh. Harganya adalah lokalitas: suku-sukunya mencakup semua mode, dan product formula punya lebih banyak suku untuk dibagi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Neither is better in general, which is the reason to keep the choice open. Write a plugin like this one to compare lowerings, to use an encoding-specific rotation, or to hand the gate to something that understands it natively.\n"
msgstr "Tidak ada yang lebih baik secara umum, dan itulah alasan untuk membiarkan pilihannya terbuka. Tulis plugin seperti ini untuk membandingkan cara penurunan, untuk memakai rotasi khusus encoding, atau untuk menyerahkan gate ke sesuatu yang memahaminya secara native.\n"

