msgid "The API documentation lists [`qiskit_bosons.circuit.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library#module-qiskit_bosons.circuit.library \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library\") for the gates, [`qiskit_bosons.linalg`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/linalg#module-qiskit_bosons.linalg \"qiskit_bosons.linalg\") for the decomposition, and [`qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes#module-qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes\") for the synthesis plugins.\n"
msgstr "Dokumentasi API mencantumkan [`qiskit_bosons.circuit.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/circuit-library#module-qiskit_bosons.circuit.library \"qiskit_bosons.circuit.library\") untuk gate, [`qiskit_bosons.linalg`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/linalg#module-qiskit_bosons.linalg \"qiskit_bosons.linalg\") untuk dekomposisi, dan [`qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/transpiler-passes#module-qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes \"qiskit_bosons.transpiler.passes\") untuk plugin sintesis.\n"

